ller)\nSlow down to tilt head back (or joystick on controller)\nChange camera by double tap on Gear VR touchpad\nNavigate menu to put marker on a button for a while\n\n\n\nEnjoyable Rocket Carz Racing will be updated constantly. Please rate and give your feedback for further improvement of the game.\nFound a bug? Please email, we will fix it.", "short_description": "Rocket Carz Racing - Future in Past! You have chance to race on Classic Old Cars using rocket engines and no wheels, following futuristic trends of 50-60th."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://okigames.com/policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://okigames.com/terms.html", "publisher_name": "OKIGAMES", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://okigames.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["RACING"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "491176319109792"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162679_274222596371902_8413503331254665216_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C6dN02uZGKAQ7kNvwFXZL-c&_nc_oc=AdokIimxh-TlUSc4G8Di8d141kb-Ng2ARNOLy9MQ0Blk2K9C-sT9YTIRIcf8eHPmcwc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af22vZEo233jvAD5GEfi1JYZMeOB2gWdsD3xOn3xamNXPA&oe=69F0B939"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Rocket Carz Racing", "platform": "ANDROID", "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "re